          ],
          "locId": null,
          "bg": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "npc",
          "speakerId": null,
          "speaker": "何生",
          "emotion": null,
          "expression": null,
          "lines": [
            "時間？邊個畀時間我呀！呢單通宵浸水做屍體job，導演指明要識做嘅人，我特登留畀你。做埋呢單，啲數一筆勾銷。"
          ],
          "locId": null,
          "bg": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "player",
          "speakerId": null,
          "speaker": "阿偉",
          "emotion": null,
          "expression": null,
          "lines": [
            "通宵做屍體？仲要浸水？呢個條件未免太苛刻啦，我聽日仲有另一個試鏡㗎。"
          ],
          "locId": null,
          "bg": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "npc",
          "speakerId": null,
          "speaker": "何生",
          "emotion": null,
          "expression": null,
          "lines": [
            "試鏡？你而家連飯都未開到，講咩試鏡！你唔接，當欠我一個大人情，以後星河電視台嘅job，你自己諗吓點搞。"
          ],
          "locId": null,
          "bg": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "player",
          "speakerId": null,
          "speaker": "阿偉",
          "emotion": null,
          "expression": null,
          "lines": [
